WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.496
A short-term rental lives or dies by its nights.

2
00:00:03.496 --> 00:00:12.211
In this walkthrough, I'll show you how to run an Airbnb-style deal in EquityFoundry, so you know what it really earns before you buy.

3
00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:15.384
Choose short-term rental at the top.

4
00:00:15.384 --> 00:00:17.427
It's part of EquityFoundry Pro.

5
00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:21.618
Add the listing link, then the price and closing costs.

6
00:00:21.618 --> 00:00:29.385
A short-term rental needs furniture and supplies before the first guest arrives, so add your furnishing and setup budget here.

7
00:00:30.185 --> 00:00:31.126
Now the income.

8
00:00:31.126 --> 00:00:36.210
Enter your nightly rate, how often you expect to be booked, and the average stay.

9
00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:42.047
Add the cleaning fee you charge guests, what each cleaning costs you, and the platform's cut.

10
00:00:42.047 --> 00:00:45.374
Similar listings nearby will give you honest numbers.

11
00:00:46.174 --> 00:00:49.060
Then the loan, the taxes and the insurance.

12
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:56.777
You pay the utilities on a short-term rental, so add those too, along with monthly supplies like coffee and linens.

13
00:00:57.577 --> 00:00:58.789
Here's your answer.

14
00:00:58.789 --> 00:01:01.595
Cash flow after every bill and the mortgage.

15
00:01:01.595 --> 00:01:05.678
Cash-on-cash return on the money you put in, furniture included.

16
00:01:05.678 --> 00:01:10.526
And revenue per night booked, so you can see what each stay is really worth.

17
00:01:11.326 --> 00:01:13.160
Occupancy moves everything.

18
00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.691
Drop it a few points and watch the cash flow shrink.

19
00:01:16.691 --> 00:01:19.475
Test the slow season before it tests you.

20
00:01:20.275 --> 00:01:26.057
The year one breakdown follows every dollar, from bookings and cleaning fees down to what's left.

21
00:01:26.857 --> 00:01:31.744
Save it, and compare it on the dashboard with your long-term rentals.

22
00:01:31.744 --> 00:01:36.561
Run your first deal at octopisceslabs.com/rental-calc.

23
00:01:36.561 --> 00:01:37.907
Forge better deals.
